m extensions are not reverse-DNS keyed\", \"extensions\")\n1009|\t\tif err != nil {\n1010|\t\t\treturn CapturePlanItem{}, err\n1011|\t\t}\n1012|\t\treturn CapturePlanItem{}, failure\n1013|\t}\n1014|\treturn CapturePlanItem{\n1015|\t\tNativeItemKey: key,\n1016|\t\tClass:         class,\n1017|\t\tByteCount:     byteCount,\n1018|\t\tRequired:      required,\n1019|\t}, nil\n1020|}","correlation_facts":{"tool_name":"read_file","outcome":"success"}}}
