ehavior change). Artifacts attached: `..._rework-evidence-rev4.md`, `..._mutant-battery-rev4.log`, `..._gates_rev4.log`; findings carried into `LOGBOOK.md`.\n\nOne process note: my first battery run reported 0/36 because `go test … | tail` returns tail's exit code — fixed to unpiped exit codes, and the rerun is the attached log.","reason":null}}
